firmware/lib/esp_lcd_co5300/ is the Espressif CO5300 panel driver from
esp-iot-solution, version 2.2.0, Apache-2.0. Its license is in
firmware/lib/esp_lcd_co5300/LICENSE. The only change in that tree is a
